# Ignore generated benchmark reports — these are produced at runtime by
# scripts/run-benchmarks.sh and should not be committed to version control.
# Upload them as CI artifacts instead.
*.json

# ...except the baseline, which is the entire point of the harness. A
# regression is only detectable against a recorded reference, and a reference
# that is not committed does not exist as far as CI is concerned. This one
# file is deliberately tracked.
#
# Re-record it with:
#   bash scripts/run-benchmarks.sh --update-baseline
# and say in the commit message why the numbers moved. See README.md here.
!baseline.json
